d metalliska egenskaper</skos:note><skos:note xml:lang="ru">Элемент, материал, проводник тока и электричества</skos:note><skos:note xml:lang="pt">Material que conduz facilmente eletricidade e calor</skos:note><skos:note xml:lang="el">Στοιχείο, ένωση ή κράμα που είναι καλός αγωγός ηλεκτρικής ενέργειας και θερμότητας.</skos:note><skos:note xml:lang="en">Element, compound, or alloy that is a good conductor of both electricity and heat; ancient Chinese element</skos:note><skos:note xml:lang="it">Elemento, composto o lega che è un buon conduttore di luce e calore</skos:note><skos:note xml:lang="fr">Classe de matériaux le plus souvent durs, opaques, brillants, bons conducteurs de la chaleur et de l’électricité, dont les atomes sont unis par des liaisons métalliques</skos:note><skos:note xml:lang="es">Elemento, aleación o compuesto conductor de electricidad y calor</skos:note><skos:note xml:lang="cs">Druh materiálu či prvku, který dobře vede proud a teplo</skos:note><skos:note xml:lang="da">Element eller legering med metalliske egenskaber</skos:note><skos:note xml:lang="nl">Ieder element dat gekenmerkt wordt door glans en het vermogen om warmte en elektriciteit te geleiden</skos:note><skos:note xml:lang="ca">Element, compost o aliatge que és bon conductor de l'electricitat i de la calor</skos:note><skos:broader rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/concept/2069"/><skos:broader rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/concept/1980"/><skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q11426"/><skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://id.ndl.go.jp/auth/ndlna/00565895"/><skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.org/bncf/tid/346"/><skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="https://www.freebase.com/m/04t7l"/><skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="https://g.co/kg/m/04t7l"/><skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300010900"/><skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://thesaurus.europeanafashion.eu/thesaurus/10545"/><skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://zbw.eu/stw/descriptor/14266-6"/><skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept641"/><skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://dbpedia.org/resource/Metal"/></skos:Concept><ore:Aggregation rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/provider/2064129/Museu_ProvidedCHO_museum_digital_9080__technical_number_"><edm:aggregatedCHO rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/2064129/Museu_ProvidedCHO_museum_digital_9080__technical_number_"/><edm:dataProvider rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/organization/1482250000004502122"></edm:dataProvider><edm:isShownAt rdf:resource="http://www.museum-digital.de/berlin/index.php?t=objekt&amp;oges=9080"/><edm:isShownBy rdf:resource="http://www.museum-digital.de/data/berlin/images/import_17/201601/29192938910.jpg"/><edm:object rdf:resource="http://www.museum-digital.de/data/berlin/images/import_17/201601/29192938910.jpg"/><edm:provider rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/organization/1482250000004671142"></edm:provider><edm:rights rdf:resource="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"/><edm:intermediateProvider rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/organization/1482250000004510547"></edm:intermediateProvider></ore:Aggregation><ore:Proxy rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/proxy/europeana/2064129/Museu_ProvidedCHO_museum_digital_9080__technical_number_"><dc:creator xml:lang="en">Telefunken GmbH/AG</dc:creator><dc:description xml:lang="en">The device is used to play the image plates of the TED system by Telefunken and Teldec. With this, about 10 minutes of motion can be played via a television set that was then commercially available. &lt;br/>
The TP 1005 of 1975 is the revised version of the equipment from 1973, which was withdrawn from the market due to technical problems. After the restart in 1975, the system worked perfectly, but the devices were hardly bought: the TED system was not competitive compared to the new video cassette formats (VCR 1971, VHS 1976).&lt;br/>
With the TED system (abbreviation for “Television Disc”), the image and sound information is mechanically stored, similar to the record. The sample is piezoelectric.&lt;br/>
&lt;br/>
Joachim Polzer: The TED Picture Plate. Methodology for Methoving the program repertoire of the German TED videodisc system Dissertation, Academy of Performing Arts in Prague (AMU/FAMU), Prague (Deutsches Technikmuseum)</dc:description><dc:format rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/concept/1766"></dc:format><dc:format xml:lang="en">metal</dc:format><dc:rights xml:lang="de">Deutsches Technikmuseum</dc:rights><dc:subject xml:lang="en">Telecommunications</dc:subject><dc:subject xml:lang="en">Picture recording</dc:subject><dc:subject xml:lang="en">Picture storage device</dc:subject><dc:title xml:lang="en">Picture disk player Telefunken TP 1005 (version 1975); TED system</dc:title><dcterms:created rdf:resource="#1975"></dcterms:created><dcterms:created xml:lang="zxx">1975</dcterms:created><dcterms:extent xml:lang="de">Objektmaß LxBxH: 310 x 460 x 200 mm; Masse: 14,52 kg</dcterms:extent><dcterms:extent xml:lang="en">Object dimension LxBxH: 310 x 460 x 200 mm; mass: 14.52 kg</dcterms:extent><dcterms:provenance xml:lang="de">Deutsches Technikmuseum, Berlin</dcterms:provenance><dcterms:provenance xml:lang="en">Deutsches Technikmuseum, Berlin</dcterms:provenance><dcterms:spatial xml:lang="de">Deutschland</dcterms:spatial><dcterms:spatial rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/place/80"></dcterms:spatial><dcterms:spatial xml:lang="en">Germany</dcterms:spatial><edm:europeanaProxy>true</edm:europeanaProxy><edm:year>1975</edm:year><ore:proxyFor rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/item/2064129/Museu_ProvidedCHO_museum_digital_9080__technical_number_"/><ore:proxyIn rdf:resource="http://data.europeana.eu/aggregation/europeana/2064129/Museu_ProvidedCHO_museum_digital_9080__technical_number_"/><edm:type>IMAGE</edm:type></ore:Proxy><ore:Proxy rdf:about="http://data.europeana.eu/proxy/provider/2064129/Museu_ProvidedCHO_museum_digital_9080__technical_number_"><dc:creator xml:lang="de">Telefunken GmbH/AG</dc:creator><dc:description xml:lang="de">Das Gerät dient zur Wiedergabe von Bildplatten des TED-System von Telefunken und Teldec. Damit lassen sich ca. 10 Minuten Bewegtbild über einen damals handelsüblichen Fernsehapparat abspielen. &lt;br />
Der TP 1005 von 1975 ist die überarbeitet Version des Geräts von 1973, das wegen technischer Probleme vom Markt zurückgezogen wurde. Nach dem Neustart 1975 funktionierte das System zwar einwandfrei, die Geräte wurden aber kaum gekauft: Das TED-System war gegenüber den damals neuen Videokassetten-Formaten (VCR 1971, VHS 1976) nicht konkurrenzfähig.&lt;br />
Beim TED-System  (Abkürzung für „Television Disc“) wird die Bild- und Ton-Information ähnlich wie bei der Schallplatte mechanisch gespeichert. Die Abtastung erfolgt piezoelektrisch.&lt;br />
